+## Park bimanual YAM arms out of the overhead view before perceiving
+
+**Trigger.** yam_real bimanual station, metric camera 'top': an object near either arm's home pose is partly hidden (fewer parts found than expected, e.g. 2 of 3 shafts). Cost: one move_to_joints per arm (~2-3 s wall, 2 motions of the episode budget), grippers empty. PARK_SWING_RAD 0.7 is the swing used on yam-isaac (arms end near y=+-0.47, z=0.91, clear of the wall).
+
+```python
+OUTWARD = {"left": 1.0, "right": -1.0}   # joint-0 sign that swings each YAM arm away from the table centre
+PARK_SWING_RAD = 0.7                       # swing used on yam-isaac; arms then sit near y=+-0.47, z=0.91
+home_joints = get_robot_state().joint_positions   # read at program start, both arms at home
+
+def park(arm):
+    target = [float(v) for v in home_joints[arm]]
+    target[0] = target[0] + OUTWARD[arm] * PARK_SWING_RAD
+    moved = move_to_joints(target, tolerance=0.02, max_steps=200, arm=arm)
+    return bool(moved.ok)
+
+for arm_name in ("left", "right"):
+    park(arm_name)
+plate = segment_text("top", "gear base plate")   # perceive only after both arms are parked
+```
+
+**Evidence.** yam_real/gear_assembly/task_0 seed 54: v00 failed 'gear base with three shafts not found' (right arm over the plate); with parking, 3 shafts found on all 10 seeds (5 dev + 5 unseen-check)
+
+*Provenance:* yam_real/gear_assembly/task_0 (yamlab Isaac Sim bridge, station yam-isaac), campaign 2026-10-19_14-32-22_gear-isaac; dev 51-55, held-out 3/10 for the whole program (fix_code.py v05). Verified 5/5 on dev seeds by an independent verifier (2026-10-19).
