+## Find raised pins/shafts on a plate and select the middle one
+
+**Trigger.** Goal names one of several identical pins/shafts standing on a plate ('the middle of the three shafts'). Segment the plate with prompt 'gear base plate' (fallback 'blue plate') on camera 'top', project with mask_to_point_cloud(..., target_frame=base_frame), and use surface_z = median z of that cloud (the plate top). min_rise 12 mm / join_r 15 mm suit ~10 mm pins about 30 mm tall spaced at least 4.5 cm apart. Reject a candidate unless exactly 3 clusters share a top height (max-min < 1 cm) at least 15 mm above surface_z, which also rejects the robot mounting plates.
+
+```python
+def raised_clusters(xs, ys, zs, surface_z, min_rise=0.012, join_r=0.015, min_pts=5):
+    order = sorted([i for i in range(len(zs)) if zs[i] > surface_z + min_rise], key=lambda i: -zs[i])
+    groups = []
+    for i in order:
+        home = None
+        for g in groups:
+            if math.hypot(xs[i] - g["sx"], ys[i] - g["sy"]) < join_r:
+                home = g
+                break
+        if home is None:
+            groups.append({"sx": xs[i], "sy": ys[i], "m": [i]})
+        else:
+            home["m"].append(i)
+    out = []
+    for g in groups:
+        if len(g["m"]) >= min_pts:
+            zmax = max(zs[i] for i in g["m"])
+            top = [i for i in g["m"] if zs[i] > zmax - 0.004]   # top disc only: side walls bias toward the camera
+            out.append({"x": sum(xs[i] for i in top) / len(top), "y": sum(ys[i] for i in top) / len(top), "ztop": zmax, "n": len(g["m"])})
+    ranked = sorted([(-out[k]["n"], k) for k in range(len(out))])
+    return [out[k] for neg_n, k in ranked[:3]]
+
+def middle_of_three(shafts):
+    pairs = [(math.hypot(shafts[i]["x"] - shafts[j]["x"], shafts[i]["y"] - shafts[j]["y"]), i, j) for i in range(3) for j in range(i + 1, 3)]
+    far = max(pairs)
+    return shafts[[k for k in range(3) if k != far[1] and k != far[2]][0]]
+```
+
+**Evidence.** found the 3 shafts and the correct middle one on all 10 seeds run (dev 51-55, unseen-check 66-70), including rotated plates (53, 54) and uneven spacing (seed 51: 7.6 cm / 4.5 cm)
+
